#
# Toska's light companion theme (paper cream, navy text, ember accents).
# Contrast is tested: creative-agent/krita-creative-agent/tests/test_toska_theme.py.
# [KritaAgent] is read by this fork only (libs/ui/thememanager.cpp); KDE ignores it. SliderFill: the fill of
# the slider spin boxes (Opacity, Size, ...), steel (#5a6f86) instead of the ember selection colour.
# MacOSAppearance: the macOS title bars and native dialogs (light, NSAppearanceNameAqua).
